.page shuf 1 shuffle lines randomly

# SYNOPSIS
*shuf* [_FILE_]

# DESCRIPTION
`shuf` reads all the lines of _FILE_ (or standard input) and writes them in random order, using the kernel's random number generator.

# EXAMPLES
    seq 1 10 | shuf
    shuf names.txt | head -1

# SEE ALSO
sort(1), omikuji(1)
